paperboy (0.11.1a-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fixed a reader-view crash when adding a note, caused by a stale
    popover parent reference across a reader-view close/reopen cycle.
  * Added factory reset and full backup/restore (OPML for feeds and
    podcasts, JSON for notes) in Preferences.
  * Replaced the html2rss extraction backend with WebKit-based
    JavaScript extraction for JS-rendered content and complex layouts.
  * Serialized feed generation behind a mutex and added malloc_trim()
    calls to stop WebView accumulation and memory growth during bulk
    regeneration.
  * Reworked sports score cards to update in place instead of
    rebuilding each poll, fixing a GTK4 leak; added a league badge
    carousel and My Teams row.
  * Reader images can now be popped out into a full-bleed viewer
    dialog.
  * Fixed several Front Page/My Feed reveal-timing bugs, a
    FeedUpdateManager deadlock, and a WebKitGTK crash on generated-feed
    regeneration timeouts.

 -- Isaac Joseph <calamityjoe87@gmail.com>  Sat, 19 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

