 -- Isaac Joseph <calamityjoe87@gmail.com>  Mon, 14 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

paperboy (0.10.1a-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Hotfix for a memory leak introduced in 0.10.0a's reader view: WebKit
    web processes were never terminating. Dropping every reference to a
    WebKit.WebView doesn't kill its sandboxed bwrap web process under
    this WebKitGTK setup - only an explicit
    webkit_web_view_terminate_web_process() call does. Every discarded
    WebView now calls it: the hidden extraction view used for
    JS-rendered articles, the main article-sheet webview swap and
    popup-sheet teardown, and reader-view video embeds.

 -- Isaac Joseph <calamityjoe87@gmail.com>  Sun, 13 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

paperboy (0.10.0a-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Added a full podcast experience: discovery, GStreamer-backed playback
    with a persistent mini-player, SQLite-backed subscriptions, and
    played/new episode tracking.
